*setterm* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''setterm(state)''

Sets the termios state for the controlling terminal. Waits for pending output to drain before applying.

*Parameters:*
- ''state'': Map of termios state (see ''chippy doc getterm'' for map fields)

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if ''state'' is not a map
- Runtime error if ''state'' is missing any termios key
- Runtime error if any value in ''state'' is not a number
- Runtime error if any value in ''state'' is out of range for its field
